DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       The  mmeemmccmmpp()  function compares the first _n bytes (each interpreted as
       _u_n_s_i_g_n_e_d _c_h_a_r) of the memory areas _s_1 and _s_2.

RREETTUURRNN VVAALLUUEE
       The mmeemmccmmpp() function returns  an  integer  less  than,  equal  to,  or
       greater than zero if the first _n bytes of _s_1 is found, respectively, to
       be less than, to match, or be greater than the first _n bytes of _s_2.

       For  a  nonzero return value, the sign is determined by the sign of the
